= Attack on Fujian

Zhili General *Sun Chuanfang* has defeated two Anhui generals for control over *Fujian*, pushing out the dying Anhui clique and imprisoning it in Zhejiang.
This does not bode well for Anhui, as it's defeat four years prior in the *Zhili-Anhui* war had basically destroyed all of it's ability to fight back.

Now that the Zhili Clique under Cao Kun is encroaching further against the Anhui, the hot topic now is *Shanghai*. Legally part of Jiangsu Province administered by Zhili General Qi Xieyuan, it has actually been controlled by Lu Yongxiang of the Anhui.
Since Shanghai is one of the largest cities in China, capturing it for the Zhili could bring many benefits for Cao Kun, Sun Chuanfang and the like.

